---
title: Sell Offer State Model (state is derived from the offer row and the clock)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available_For_Buying: Offer published with expires_on

    Available_For_Buying --> Available_For_Processing: Lock granted
    Available_For_Processing --> Available_For_Paying: Lock granted
    Available_For_Paying --> Available_For_Paying: Owner repeats request, lock exchanged
    Available_For_Paying --> Available_For_Buying: Payment failed or paying interval ended
    Available_For_Paying --> Payment_Pending: Pre-payment completed
    Available_For_Paying --> Expired: Paying interval ended after expires_on
    Payment_Pending --> Executed: Pre-payment completed
    Payment_Pending --> Available_For_Buying: Pre-payment expired

    Available_For_Buying --> Withdrawn: Withdrawn

    Executed --> [*]
    Withdrawn --> [*]

    note right of Available_For_Buying
        Visible to buyers, Purchase enabled.
        Block returns to the pool on Expired.
    end note

    note right of Available_For_Processing
        Reached only through a successful lock.
        Now is before paying_until.
        Checked before Expired, so a paying offer
        past expires_on is not cut off.
    end note

    note right of Available_For_Paying
        Reached only through a successful lock.
        Now is before paying_until.
        Checked before Expired, so a paying offer
        past expires_on is not cut off.
    end note

    note right of Payment_Pending
        Reached only through a successful lock.
        Waits for pre-payment confirmation or expiration.
    end note